#: 2b124e82724e4099a9711601744c9eea 633e4c60aa1342e2bc0c6c7ad2dbca2b
#: 7b449b2b34d0455fab798fc6866fa314 85f434403cb4465b9969a4aa4d9c044e
#: ebd45cc1a1be46aba0a2f09b2af2e4f4 f43d147779904e09a5c6fa4b3cd169b8
msgid ""
"Due to flash memory limitations, this board does not include all ArduPilot "
"features. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations<common-limited_firmware>` for "
"details. In addition, it is being built only for Copter on the `Firmware "
"server <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__. Also note, that with the "
"exception of a special firmware version of the AIO variant that allows "
"disabling the integrated ELRS receiver to allow an external compass to be "
"used along with a GPS, it is recommended that only ACRO, STABILIZE, and "
"ALTHOLD (requires Baro) modes of Copter are used for safest operation."
msgstr ""
"由于闪存容量限制，此飞控不包含所有 ArduPilot 功能。详见 :ref:`固件限制<common-"
"limited_firmware>`。此外，它仅在 `固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 上为 "
"Copter 构建。还请注意，除了 AIO 版本的一个特殊固件（允许禁用集成 ELRS 接收机以配合 GPS 使用外置罗盘）外，建议仅使用 Copter"
" 的 Acro、Stabilize 和 AltHold（需要气压计）模式以确保最安全的操作。"

