msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:169
#: 08d2ddaa0a3348a6a589eb7b9c716c97 2ec20f5f65aa484ba267122bdb17d1c4
#: 354057eb5aaf4c50861fc2dfbb7f2d14 552870d1635a4dd995f438f61c2595dc
#: 595e1746fc6e45298c89709c0855222a e3977634964c441e820b210466dd97fc
msgid ""
"On the Whoop and AIO versions, UART3 is tied internally to a 2.4GHz ELRS "
"receiver module and defaulted to that protocol. On the Toothpick the SBUS "
"pin is inverted and tied to UART3 RX and supports all ArduPilot "
"unidirectional protocols except PPM."
msgstr ""
"在 Whoop 和 AIO 版本上，UART3 内部连接到 2.4GHz ELRS 接收机模块，并默认使用该协议。Toothpick 版本的 SBUS "
"引脚经反相后连接到 UART3 RX，支持所有 ArduPilot 单向协议（PPM 除外）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:171
#: 0d8d22ab4629424a9a2400bd25a22e2d 3fbf37a955d54440835e504b5ed4ef2b
#: 8f6e8e46aebc40349d450354dbd0c7a4 92d103f021e243a780acbfa548dab0c8
#: ac1f8e2914cd4e32be603ecb549bfe2e d8da226a94564d5799b280bcd76788a5
msgid "All units have an SBUS input which is inverted and tied to a UART:"
msgstr "所有型号均有 SBUS 输入，经反相后连接到某个 UART："

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:173
#: 0843558502134de08837e5f3f428f95f 288d8a5c9aaa403c9f2c2298e5537148
#: 393fc2e444214a7d99bb6a93e8da3725 b4c351726fde48508383cf778379abeb
#: d956d17206fd495dacd7d3e8c2785131 f2d8e534bea7430ab9b6be45b6de36d0
msgid ""
"Whoop would need :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` set to \"23\" and"
" :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` set to some other protocol in "
"order to function as a unidirectional RC input."
msgstr ""
"Whoop 需将 :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 设为 「23」，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` 设为其他协议，才能用作单向 RC 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:174
#: a59cec9e63044e10b427aae65fb0fe82 a6a3eab4d58643eaa94cf2a0d9af033a
#: aedde0401cbe4e48b8047ead8c1f2f10 c882690757f746f6a2673ce9f08a4b41
#: d566c7ad5169490a82e0ea4cff92436e faa0ebe4058644328e24d4a1d1df1f16
msgid ""
"AIO would need :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` set to \"23\" and "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` set to some other protocol in "
"order to function as a unidirectional RC input."
msgstr ""
"AIO 需将 :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 设为 「23」，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` 设为其他协议，才能用作单向 RC 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:175
#: 0a634d86fed04f3ea4c4d1044e2817d0 2cb8a2ee124c4c5ea4ee791e2af0c067
#: 4b811adacdef450aa680d3c8bb24e1e9 573399d104e746c7b6b4d4198d5ee01e
#: 8672cbafd8f84a3a8f88994058775bb1 c130ee6d0ed345ee80affb3dcbb4cfa2
msgid ""
"Toothpick uses this as it main RCinput by default since it has no internal "
"ELRS module."
msgstr "Toothpick 由于没有内部 ELRS 模块，默认将此用作主 RC 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:177
#: 02204ce0c2754320a2fa8cff8cd4d16b 5367253039f24faa801cb8339d235212
#: 55cc6b40e9d74b6b8fcb48684b7f7658 64ccfdedff97496d8cd55be3d2a8fe46
#: cf6a9217bc1941ae891a7622ad4235fc f209fe7a89354d53a62f840389bfb3f6
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion "
"on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"任意 UART 也可用于 ArduPilot 中的 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议（SBUS 在其他 UART "
"上需要外部反相器）。详情参见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

