#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:203
#: 01ad838bae4f408596ee59833ddc56b6 85ce42b854e642be9fd6a018ab138c01
#: a5fe60a04aa64e21bf1cb70f30a07c4f b129cec1ed27497a9e1fda96b06579cd
#: bf38990ed950408696daa0e106cfbedd dfbbdd3eb46046f4ac1bb84abe7c6335
msgid "Connecting a GPS/Compass module"
msgstr "连接 GPS/罗盘模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:205
#: 031d5cc68af54d2c90e624b9e119a816 12e966e259f34e7086dcc5a7185dda9d
#: 158777a0a8f34e3bb954a9c928293e51 6c7919ef6cc0484c96d64930bee13c8f
#: 7914864416464abcb3a38cdcf5b19d27 e15182d03ea8413d8f7d3c34efea4462
msgid ""
"This board does not include a GPS and compass so an :ref:`external GPS "
"<common-positioning-landing-page>` can be connected to allow operation of "
"position holding/tracking modes (ie LOITER,etc.). However, only the AIO has "
"the ability to disconnect its ELRS module to provide the required access to "
"the UART3 RX/TX pins to attach an I2C compass. This also requires special "
"firmware (see below) be installed to convert these pins from UART use to I2C"
" use with RX3 becoming SDA and TX3 becoming SCL."
msgstr ""
"此飞控不包含 GPS 和罗盘，可以连接 :ref:`外置 GPS <common-positioning-landing-page>` "
"以实现位置保持/追踪模式（如 Loiter 等）。但只有 AIO 版本具备断开其 ELRS 模块的能力，以提供对 UART3 RX/TX "
"引脚的访问来连接 I2C 罗盘。这还需要安装特殊固件（见下文），将这些引脚从 UART 用途转换为 I2C 用途（RX3 变为 SDA，TX3 变为 "
"SCL）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:207
#: 022e6a143f5849cd8bd999b01dd257bb 35120c65acfc42d78dd861615ee74888
#: 46880156515e4e5d91882d1a04db1f1a 6b6db9ad4d664b23b929833be802f7b6
#: 9f62bd01405040c99e191d40c51cc7b6 ffdb4eaaed9547729cacc3c72de66061
msgid ""
"since a compass cannot be normally attached, only ACRO, STABILIZE, and "
"ALTHOLD (if the unit has a BARO) modes are recommended. GSF (:ref:`common-"
"compassless`)can be used, but requires pre-flight actions to converge it "
"before taking off, and it is susceptible to failures in flight."
msgstr ""
"由于通常无法连接罗盘，仅推荐使用 Acro、Stabilize 和 AltHold（如果该型号有气压计）模式。GSF（:ref:`common-"
"compassless`）可以使用，但需要在起飞前进行预飞行操作使其收敛，且容易在飞行中发生故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:210
#: 2d24aaa9f23f479ca7c2a5e100cf7c66 622e4884693a4495a6015304efe33fcd
#: 67532fdf72a544149140d523d7a64f3d 6e42e5415ea74568ac064d066b7abdb4
