msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:211
#: 010d37a288994e66b7a67bd541d50e68 16d0a58268ed40d8b97ba3128586e21b
#: 57406d44b17e41479c25b078b04e1c70 5cdda1b085864504914f0454b00695eb
#: 6341fcdc73934e54ab2cf5cdb61b45c3 a8da871f805243588ef7bf67251165bb
msgid ""
"This board does not come with ArduPilot firmware pre-installed. Use "
"instructions here to load ArduPilot the first time :ref:`common-loading-"
"firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`."
msgstr ""
"此飞控板不预装ArduPilot固件。首次加载ArduPilot请参照 :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"chibios-only-boards` 的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:213
#: 5a0e2888055a44d598073693a4ade2da
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"BETAFPV-F405\"."
" For the AIO version, a firmware labeled \"BETAFPV-F405-I2C\" is provided to"
" allow I2C devices to be attached if the hardware modification metioned "
"above is made to disconnect the ELRS module from those signals."
msgstr ""
"此飞控的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 标有 「BETAFPV-F405」的子文件夹中找到。对于"
" AIO 版本，提供了标有 「BETAFPV-F405-I2C」的固件，在进行上述硬件改装断开 ELRS 模块后，允许连接 I2C 设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:213
#: 7a1d942abc234e9ab506838730e087c9 7b4543f4bd0949948cb37ed95fe1a76a
#: 9516418ca27445f9a61f530c6e179799 a84f2455e7f443e7a0b0e8840986f371
#: cff3b3b636eb41eabaa4a05bdb1c88c0
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"BETAFPV-F405\"."
" For the AIO version, a firmware labeled \"BETAFPV-F405-I2C\" is provided to"
" allow I2C devices to be attached if the hardware modification mentioned "
"above is made to disconnect the ELRS module from those signals."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `这里 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 名为 \"BETAFPV-F405\" "
"的子文件夹中找到。对于 AIO 版本，提供了名为 \"BETAFPV-F405-I2C\" 的固件；若已按上文所述进行硬件改动、将 ELRS "
"模块与这些信号断开，即可外接 I2C 设备。"
